        "id": 91456,
        "name": "Hardboiledgregg",
        "username": "HotHeart",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/hotheart/{size}/2575_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-15T16:46:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the six-player thing was more of an experiment…and my friends always loved to randomise, so we wound up with that villain.</p>\n<p>Would you believe they don't like to play anymore…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rage.png?v=9\" title=\":rage:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rage:\"></p>\n<p>They actually might have enjoyed SotM more if they bothered to learn the playstyles, find heroes they like, figured out what made for a decent challenge and didn't just want to randomise the whole time. Oh well…</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:17:05.745Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
