      {
        "id": 91457,
        "name": "boxerboyhomer",
        "username": "boxerboyhomer",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e480ec/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-19T17:13:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've done multiple games with 8 heroes. &nbsp;Villan hits that use the H-mechanic are very, very powerful. &nbsp;We've even lost one or two games even with all the extra hero-damage. &nbsp;The main downside to 5+ games are how long each round goes, so players can get board. &nbsp;</p><p>You do run into some issues with some villans. &nbsp;Like Iron Legacy needing to put out ongoings equal to the number of heroes. &nbsp;I don't remember exactly how many ongoing he has so he may not have enough. &nbsp;You do run out of infections with Plague Rat. &nbsp;We've done him twice with 7+. &nbsp;Once we did that when one person a second person got a copy as well, even though we didn't have a second physical copy. &nbsp;So this way eventually everyone had one. &nbsp;The other time we just based his flip on if all infections were played on a player, even though we had some players not infected.</p><p><span>But other than that, they're actually very do-able. &nbsp;The H-mechanic really does a good job of balancing for both 5+ games and 2 player games.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:17:05.817Z",
