      {
        "id": 91458,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-19T18:24:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"boxerboyhomer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e480ec/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> boxerboyhomer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The H-mechanic really does a good job of balancing for both 5+ games and 2 player games.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually it does a terrible job for 2-player games because a lot of instances are H-2.&nbsp; And raising some instances to 6 can go pear-shaped, although it might be workable.</p>",
