      {
        "id": 91459,
        "name": "boxerboyhomer",
        "username": "boxerboyhomer",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e480ec/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-20T14:02:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The instances of H-2 can be a bit too easy for some two-hero teamups, but makes it possible for others, so it balances. &nbsp;Could it be better? Sure, but it works decent enough. &nbsp;And yeah, some hits, especially H+2 get very scary very quickly, but it works due to the large number of heroes. &nbsp;Just be prepared that some heroes are going to get incappacitated. &nbsp;</p>",
