        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/shadowagent/{size}/2191_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-24T20:10:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>my group has played many 6 player games... with 6 players you have a lot of options... but you also take a lot of damage...&nbsp;<br><br>6 players against the Dreamer is tough... really tough.&nbsp;<br><br>When we play 6 players we always play \"Advanced\" mode... and they does make the game a lot more balanced.&nbsp;<br>We have lost a bunch... especially when we randomly choose our heroes.&nbsp;</p>",
