        "created_at": "2014-03-05T22:26:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>Maybe the villain can draw 3 cards at the beginning of the game. Then on his or her turn he or she can either play one of the cards on hand or blindly play the one on top of the deck. At the end of the turn they don't draw a new card, but at any point the villain can skip his Or her Play phase to bring their hand up to 3 cards again.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Or something along those lines... haven't actually tested any of this.&nbsp;</div>",
